msgid "A World Without a Written Destination."
msgstr ""

msgid "There is no prescribed route. Set your own pace: explore, build, mine, or let the landscape suggest a direction. This story is yours."
msgstr ""

msgid "What You Do Defines You."
msgstr ""

msgid "Mining, forging, combat, exploration, and crafting each leave a different mark. What you choose to practice shapes your progress; there is no single way forward."
msgstr ""

msgid "Forge Your Own Path."
msgstr ""

msgid "No permanent class locks you into a role. Try skills from different disciplines and grow your Mastery at your own pace."
msgstr ""

msgid "Not Everything Is in Sight."
msgstr ""

msgid "There is more to discover than what you see at first, but nothing demands that you go in a particular direction. Explore when you are ready and let curiosity guide you."
msgstr ""

msgid "The World Continues With You."
msgstr ""

msgid "Your journey does not end with this welcome. Build, change, and inhabit the world around you. When you close this card, the wider world is yours to explore."
msgstr ""

msgid "Your First Tools"
msgstr ""

msgid "Collect logs. Open your inventory, place logs in the crafting grid, and take the planks. Use them to make a crafting table; the recipe book (book icon) shows how to make a wooden axe."
msgstr ""

msgid "Learn by Doing"
msgstr ""

msgid "Try mining, forging, combat, exploration, or crafting. Use /everforge to see the five disciplines and available skills. There is no required order."
msgstr ""

msgid "Prepare Your Shelter"
msgstr ""

msgid "Build a shelter that suits you. Gather food and keep an eye on your health and hunger as you settle in."
msgstr ""

msgid "Discover the Unknown"
msgstr ""

msgid "Head out whenever you like. Take in the landscape and choose your own direction; exploration has no required objectives."
msgstr ""

